### CiteConnect API Requests

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = 
 @prodUrl = https://citeconnect-backend-api-897523647765.us-central1.run.app/api/v1

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### User Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tuser27@gmail.com",
  "password": "tUser1235",
  "full_name": "Test User 4"
}

### User Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tuser25@gmail.com",
  "password": "tUser1234"
}

### Create User Profile (replace {user_id})
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "primary_domain": "healthcare",
  "reading_level": "advanced",
  "interests": ["machine learning", "medical imaging", "diagnostics"],
  "research_stage": "phd",
  "years_experience": 3
}

### Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User State
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search Papers
POST {{baseUrl}}/papers/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "deep learning medical imaging",
  "limit": 10
}

### Get Recommendations (requires paper data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "user_id": 2,
  "count": 5,
  "model_preference": "all-MiniLM-L6-v2",
  "session_id": "test-session-x"
}

### Track Interaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "paper_id": "paper_id_here",
  "interaction_type": "save",
  "context": {
    "source": "recommendation",
    "position": 1,
    "session_id": "test-session-1"
  }
}


### 1. Get Full Citation Network (Depth 1, 50 nodes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/c8b25fab5608c3e033d34b4483ec47e68ba109b7?depth=1&max_nodes=50&include_metadata=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}